{"name":"PostProcessVolume","kind":"component","module":"render","doc":"A region whose post-processing overrides blend in as the camera approaches and enters it. Volumes apply in ascending <code>priority</code> (ties in entity ID order); each property one overrides moves toward its value by the volume&#39;s weight at the camera. Properties no volume overrides keep the engine defaults. Scenes saved with the former <code>PostProcess</code> component load as one global volume that overrides everything.","fields":[{"name":"shape","typeHtml":"<a href=\"/docs/reference/types/VolumeShape\">VolumeShape</a>","doc":"Where the volume applies: everywhere, or inside a box or sphere placed and sized by the entity&#39;s transform.","default":"\"global\"","options":["global","box","sphere"]},{"name":"blendDistance","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Distance outside the box or sphere over which the volume fades out; 0 is a hard edge.","default":"0","unit":"m","range":"0 – 1000","showIf":"shape is box or sphere"},{"name":"priority","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Order among overlapping volumes: higher priorities apply after, and over, lower ones.","default":"0","range":"-1000 – 1000"},{"name":"weight","typeHtml":"f32","doc":"Overall strength of the volume&#39;s overrides, from 0 (none) to 1 (full).","default":"1","range":"0 – 1"},{"name":"overrides","typeHtml":"list&lt;<a href=\"/docs/reference/types/PostOverride\">PostOverride</a>&gt;","doc":"The settings this volume changes, one entry per group. Anything not listed comes from lower-priority volumes or the defaults.","default":"[]"}],"variants":[],"usedBy":{"types":[],"commands":[]},"usage":[{"label":"Add it","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> component.add </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p component</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">PostProcessVolume </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">--</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Add PostProcessVolume\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"Set a field","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">ara </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">do</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> property.set </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">name:Crate </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p path</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">PostProcessVolume.shape </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">-</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">p value</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"global\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> --</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">why </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"Tune PostProcessVolume\"</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"In a scene document","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">  \"PostProcessVolume\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">    \"shape\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">: </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\">\"global\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"},{"label":"From C#","html":"<pre class=\"shiki ara\" style=\"background-color:var(--code-background);color:var(--code-fg)\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">/// &#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">summary</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">>Call each fixed tick with a room trigger's occupancy to fade its camera treatment in and out.&#x3C;/</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-property)\">summary</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-comment)\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">public</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> static</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> void</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\"> UsePostProcessVolume</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">Entity</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> entity, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">bool</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> playerInside, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">in</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> Tick</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> tick)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">    ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> var</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> volume </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> ref</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> World.</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\">Get</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\">PostProcessVolume</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">>(entity);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    volume.Shape </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> VolumeShape.Box;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    volume.BlendDistance </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 2f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    volume.Weight </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> Math.</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-function)\">Clamp</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">(volume.Weight </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">+</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> (playerInside </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">?</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 2f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> :</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\"> -</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">2f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">) </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">*</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> tick.Dt, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">0f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">, </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\">1f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    volume.Overrides </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">        new</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostOverride</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">            Module </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> PostModule.ColorGrading, WhiteBalance </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 4500f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">, Saturation </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 0.8f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">            Lut </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-string)\"> \"@textures/security_lut.png#as_alarm\"</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">, LutContribution </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 0.6f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">        new</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostOverride</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">            Module </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> PostModule.DepthOfField, FocusDistance </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 8f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">, Aperture </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 2.8f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">            NearBlur </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 0.5f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">, FarBlur </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 1f</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">        new</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-type)\"> PostOverride</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> { Module </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> PostModule.MotionBlur, ShutterAngle </span><span style=\"color:var(--code-keyword)\">=</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-number)\"> 180f</span><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">    ];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--code-fg)\">}</span></span></code></pre>"}],"csharp":"PostProcessVolume"}
